<title>POLAND: Polish dwellings output rises 33.1 pct m/m in Feb.</title>
<headline>Polish dwellings output rises 33.1 pct m/m in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in February rose 33.1 percent from January and was 32.5-percent higher than in February 1996, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said 5,011 flats were completed in February, bringing the total for the January-February period to 8,775 flats.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT	  FEBRUARY  JANUARY     FEB 1996</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	 33.1    -74.0	   n.a.</p>
<p> number of flats built	   5,011    3,764	  3,782</p>
